    </category>
        <excerpt>
      <Value Culture="en-US"><![CDATA[Every institution knows what&#8217;s coming. When the application season is open, enrollment deadlines start to pile up, and suddenly, a team that handled things reasonably well last month is struggling to keep up with demand.]]></Value>
    </excerpt>
